alse\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3.5</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, compute both\nintervals and explain why they lean in opposite directions.</p>","file":"ch23-resampling-inference/03-confidence-intervals.html"}